@{b}1.6. Python on Debian GNU/Linux @{ub}

If you are lucky enough to be running Debian GNU/Linux, you install Python through the @{b}apt@{ub} command.

@{b}Example 1.3. Installing on Debian GNU/Linux @{ub}

@{code}

localhost:~$ su -
Password: [enter your root password]
localhost:~# apt-get install python
